Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}很多朋友觉得车载
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:02.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}之下装起来麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:03.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}但这个不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:04.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}拧一下就能锁紧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:05.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}不用胶黏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:06.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}也不会卡住出风口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:07.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}更不用充电
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:09.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}随便找个平整的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}一放就吸住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:11.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}想换个位置
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}反正拧一下就取下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}特别灵活
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}它的支撑臂可以多断条
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:16.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}不管什么车型
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:17.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}什么角度都能适应
